#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:190
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Toonpingel"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:198
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "&Systeempingel bruken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:200
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr "&Egen Pingel bruken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:202
msgid "If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the \"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. Normally, this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt de Standardsysteempingel bruukt. Wenn Du ehr instellen wullt, denn kiek binnen dat Kuntrullzentrum bi \"Kläng un Multimedia\" ünner \"Systeempingel\" na. Normalerwies is dat bloots en \"Piep\"."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:205
msgid ""
"<p>Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound file. If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell.</p>"
"<p> Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the event causing the bell and the sound being played.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn Du disse Optschoon anmaakst, kannst Du en Klangdatei för de Pingel fastleggen. Wenn Du dat deist, schullst Du de Systeempingel utmaken.</p>"
"<p> Op langsame Reekners kann dat wull wesen, dat dor en lütt Tiet twischen Begeefnis un Klang liggt.</p>"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:213
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "&Klang för't Afspelen:"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:217
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Utsöken..."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:219
msgid "If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound file here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr "Wenn de Optschoon \"Egen Pingel bruken\" anmaakt is, kannst Du hier en Datei utsöken. Klick op \"Utsöken...\", wenn Du en Datei op dien Reekner utsöken wullt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:236
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Ogenpingel"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:244
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "Ogenpingel br&uken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:246
msgid "This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially useful for deaf people."
msgstr "Disse Optschoon maakt de \"Ogenpingel\" an. A.B. bluckt de Schirm op, wenn normalerwies de Pingel geiht. Dat is goot för doof Lüüd."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:253
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "Klöre&n ümkehren"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:257
msgid "All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr "All Klören op den Schirm warrt för de nerrn fastleggte Tiet ümkehrt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:259
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "Schirm opb&lucken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:261
msgid "The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr "De Schirm warrt för de nerrn fastleggte Tiet mit en sülven instellte Klöör infarvt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:267
msgid "Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr "Klicken hier, wenn Du de Klöör utsöken wullt, mit de de Schirm bi't Opblucken infarvt warrt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:277
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "Wo lang:"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:278 kcmaccess.cpp:392 kcmaccess.cpp:432
msgid " msec"
msgstr " ms"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:280
msgid "Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being shown."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wo lang de \"Ogenpingel\" wiest warrt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:297
msgid "&Bell"
msgstr "&Pingel"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:305
msgid "S&ticky Keys"
msgstr "&Backige Tasten"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:313
msgid "Use &sticky keys"
msgstr "Backige Ta&sten bruken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:319
msgid "&Lock sticky keys"
msgstr "\"Backige Tasten\" f&aststellen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:325
msgid "Turn sticky keys off when two keys are pressed simultaneously"
msgstr "\"Backige Tasten\" utmaken, wenn twee Tasten to de sülve Tiet drückt warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:331
msgid "Use system bell whenever a modifier gets latched, locked or unlocked"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel bruken, wenn en Sünnertast faststellt, blockeert oder freegeven warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:334
msgid "Locking Keys"
msgstr "Fastsetttasten"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:342
msgid "Use system bell whenever a locking key gets activated or deactivated"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel bruken, wenn en Faststelltast aktiv oder inaktiv warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:345
msgid "Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a modifier or locking key changes its state"
msgstr "KDE-Systeemnaricht bruken, wenn en Sünner- oder Faststelltast den Tostand ännert"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:351 kcmaccess.cpp:518
msgid "Configure &Notifications..."
msgstr "&Bescheden instellen..."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:368
msgid "&Modifier Keys"
msgstr "&Sünnertasten"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:374
msgid "Slo&w Keys"
msgstr "&Langsame Tasten"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:382
msgid "&Use slow keys"
msgstr "Langsame Tasten br&uken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:393
msgid "Acceptance dela&y:"
msgstr "&Tiet ehr övernahmen warrt:"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:399
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is pressed"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel br&uken, wenn en Tast drückt warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:405
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is accepted"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel br&uken, wenn en Tast övernahmen warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:411
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel br&uken, wenn en Tast torüchwiest warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:414
msgid "Bounce Keys"
msgstr "Springen Tasten"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:422
msgid "Use bou&nce keys"
msgstr "Springe&n Tasten bruken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:433
msgid "D&ebounce time:"
msgstr "Ti&et ehr de Tast torüchspringt:"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:439
msgid "Use the system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "Jümmers Systeempingel bruken, wenn en Tast torüchwiest warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:457
msgid "&Keyboard Filters"
msgstr "&Tastatuurfiltern"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:464 kcmaccess.cpp:534
msgid "Activation Gestures"
msgstr "Anmaaktekens"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:472
msgid "Use gestures for activating sticky keys and slow keys"
msgstr "Tekens för't Anmaken vun Backige un Langsame Tasten bruken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:476
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following features: \n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du Tastatuurtekens aktiveren, de disse Metoden anmaakt: \n"
"Backige Tasten: Drück de Ümschalttast 5 Maal in een Reeg naenanner\n"
"Langsame Tasten: Laat de Ümschalttast för 8 Sekunnen daaldrückt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:480
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following features: \n"
"Mouse Keys: %1\n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du Tastatuurtekens aktiveren, de disse Metoden anmaakt:\n"
"Muustasten: %1\n"
"Backige Tasten: Drück de Ümschalttast 5 Maal in een Reeg naenanner\n"
"Langsame Tasten: Laat de Ümschalttast för 8 Sekunnen daaldrückt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:485
msgid "Turn sticky keys and slow keys off after a certain period of inactivity."
msgstr "Backige un Langsame Tasten na en wiss Tiet utmaken, wenn nix daan warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:492
msgid " min"
msgstr " Min."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:494
msgid "Timeout:"
msgstr "Paus:"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:497
msgid "Notification"
msgstr "Naricht"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:505
msgid "Use the system bell whenever a gesture is used to turn an accessibility feature on or off"
msgstr "Jümmers de Systeempingel bruken, wenn en Togangwarktüüch mit en Teken an- oder utmaakt warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:508
msgid "Show a confirmation dialog whenever a keyboard accessibility feature is turned on or off"
msgstr "Jümmers nafragen, wenn en Togangwarktüüch an- oder utmaakt warrt"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:510
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, KDE will show a confirmation dialog whenever a keyboard accessibility feature is turned on or off.\n"
"Ensure you know what you are doing if you uncheck it, as the keyboard accessibility settings will then always be applied without confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, fraagt KDE jümmers na, wenn en Tastatuurmetood an- oder utmaakt warrt.\n"
"Bitte wees Di dor över kloor, wat Du deist, wenn Du dit utmaakst - de Instellen för Tastatuurmetoden warrt denn jümmers ahn Nafraag bruukt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmaccess.cpp:512
msgid "Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a keyboard accessibility feature is turned on or off"
msgstr "Jümmers de KDE-Systeemnarichten bruken, wenn en Togangwarktüüch an- oder utmaakt warrt"

